	PRINTL 
	;ぶっちゃけて言うならこのスロットはプレイヤーの溜まりに溜まったカリスマをナイアガラさせるために作られた殺戮マシーン
	;大袈裟に言うなら「1万回に1回101万当たる100円くじをあなたは当たるまで引き続けられますか？」
	PRINTL ・General
	PRINTL 　　　Normal State:　From here, the goal is to win a Bonus, or even achieve ART.
	PRINTL 　　　The Bonus is won by playing the required number of Games or by scoring a rare combo payout.
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　The upper limit is ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("999G",C_RED) + PRINT_COLOR(".",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　There are three internal states: ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("1 Normal",0xFFFFFF) + PRINT_COLOR(", ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("2 High",C_YELLOW) + PRINT_COLOR(", and ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("3 Super High",C_RED) + PRINT_COLOR(".",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　If the internal state at the time of scoring a Minor Combo is ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("2 High",C_YELLOW) + PRINT_COLOR(" or ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("3 Super High",C_RED) + PRINT_COLOR(", the Bonus Game is performed ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("2",C_YELLOW) + PRINT_COLOR(" or ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("3",C_RED) + PRINT_COLOR(" times, respectively.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTL 　　　In addition, there is no direct roll for ART, and if ART is achieved, the machine goes into the ART state regardless of the bonus.
	PRINTL 　　　The theoretical value of Coins (Charisma) during Normal State is 27.08 [G/50 Coins] w/o Bonus and 31.83 [G/50 Coins] w/ Bonus.
	PRINTL 
	PRINTL ↓Bonus Acquisition
	PRINTL 
	PRINTL ・Bonus
	PRINTL 　　　Technically, there is no bonus state.
	PRINTL 　　　All bonuses are subject to an ART activation roll on the Game in which the bonus is activated.
	PRINTL 　　　When ART is achieved, the machine will enter the ART state for the duration of the Game.
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　There are three types of bonuses: ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("Scarlet BB (400pts)",色_RED7) + PRINT_COLOR(", ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("Izayoi BB (200pts)",色_BLUE7) + PRINT_COLOR(", and ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("REG (100pts)",0xFFFFFF) + PRINT_COLOR(".",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTL 　　　The odds of achieving ART for each is as follows:
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　　　",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("Scarlet BB",色_RED7) + PRINT_COLOR("　     1/2(*)",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　　　",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("Izayoi BB",     色_BLUE7) + PRINT_COLOR("　　　　1/3",    C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　　　",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("REG ",         0xFFFFFF) + PRINT_COLOR("　　　　　　 1/5",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　Exceptions: ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("Scarlet BB",色_RED7) + PRINT_COLOR(" scored by Mid-Line Cherry or Freeze always achieve ART.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTL 
	PRINTL ↓ART Acquisition
	PRINTL 
	PRINTL ・ART　[NIGHTLESS TIME]
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　Each set lasts up to 32G.",C_GREEN) + PRINT_COLOR(" The set ends when a Bonus is scored, upon which the machine moves on to the next set.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTL 　　　This repeats until you fail the consecutive streak.
	PRINTL 　　　Although we call it ART, it's actually a Bonus loop with a 32G limit.
	PRINTL 　　　This behavior is reminiscent of a Type 4 Pachislo machine.
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　Initially, the ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("ART state streak rate",C_ORANGE) + PRINT_COLOR(" is determined at the time it is achieved.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　Additionally, during ART activation, a roll is performed to determine ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("the duration of the next state",C_ORANGE) + PRINT_COLOR(" based on the current streak rate.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　Even if the streak is lost, ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("a duration renewal roll",C_ORANGE) + PRINT_COLOR(" is performed each Game based on the Minor Combo scored during the set.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTL 　　　If the streak was broken, the machine will return to a Normal State at the end of the 32G set.
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　Moreover, the roll is performed to ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("change the streak rate",C_ORANGE) + PRINT_COLOR(" based on scored Minor Combos during the set at the same time for each Game.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTL 　　　This behavior basically increases the streak rate as the set progresses.
	
	;95%なんて引き当てた日には、一撃万枚どころか2万枚が基本線なんだよなぁ
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　The maximum streak rate is ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("95％",C_RED) + PRINT_COLOR(", but the actual streak rate can be much higher from scored Minor Combos.",C_WHITE)%
	PRINTFORML %PRINT_COLOR("　　　With a ",C_WHITE) + PRINT_COLOR("95％",C_RED) + PRINT_COLOR(" streak rate, you have a very real chance of winning 10,000 points at once!",C_WHITE)%
	
	
	;ここの、純増10.3枚[/G]がキモ　機械割の大部分がここに取られているので当たらないときはかなりキツイ
	PRINTL 　　　The theoretical net gain is 1.6 Points[/G] w/o Bonus, and 10.3 Points[/G] w/ Bonus at the end of a set.
	PRINTL 
